   6:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   *          This file provides firmware functions to manage the following
   7:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   *          functionalities of the CORTEX:
   8:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   *           + Initialization and Configuration functions
