  23:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   ==============================================================================
  24:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****                         ##### How to use this driver #####
  25:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   ==============================================================================
  26:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
  27:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     [..]
  28:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     *** How to configure Interrupts using CORTEX HAL driver ***
  29:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     ===========================================================
  30:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     [..]
  31:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     This section provides functions allowing to configure the NVIC interrupts (IRQ).
  32:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     The Cortex-M4 exceptions are managed by CMSIS functions.
  33:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
  34:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     (#) Configure the NVIC Priority Grouping using HAL_NVIC_SetPriorityGrouping() function.
  35:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     (#) Configure the priority of the selected IRQ Channels using HAL_NVIC_SetPriority().
  36:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     (#) Enable the selected IRQ Channels using HAL_NVIC_EnableIRQ().
  37:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
  38:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****      -@- When the NVIC_PRIORITYGROUP_0 is selected, IRQ pre-emption is no more possible.
  39:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****          The pending IRQ priority will be managed only by the sub priority.
  40:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
  41:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****      -@- IRQ priority order (sorted by highest to lowest priority):
  42:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (+@) Lowest pre-emption priority
  43:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (+@) Lowest sub priority
  44:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (+@) Lowest hardware priority (IRQ number)
  45:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
  46:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     [..]
  47:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     *** How to configure SysTick using CORTEX HAL driver ***
  48:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     ========================================================
  49:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     [..]
  50:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     Setup SysTick Timer for time base.
  51:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
  52:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****    (+) The HAL_SYSTICK_Config() function calls the SysTick_Config() function which
  53:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****        is a CMSIS function that:
  54:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Configures the SysTick Reload register with value passed as function parameter.
  55:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Configures the SysTick IRQ priority to the lowest value (0x0F).
  56:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Resets the SysTick Counter register.
  57:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Configures the SysTick Counter clock source to be Core Clock Source (HCLK).
  58:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Enables the SysTick Interrupt.
  59:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Starts the SysTick Counter.
  60:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
  61:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****    (+) You can change the SysTick Clock source to be HCLK_Div8 by calling the macro
  62:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****        __HAL_CORTEX_SYSTICKCLK_CONFIG(SYSTICK_CLKSOURCE_HCLK_DIV8) just after the
  63:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****        HAL_SYSTICK_Config() function call. The __HAL_CORTEX_SYSTICKCLK_CONFIG() macro is defined
  64:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****        inside the stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.h file.
  65:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
  66:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****    (+) You can change the SysTick IRQ priority by calling the
  67:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****        HAL_NVIC_SetPriority(SysTick_IRQn,...) function just after the HAL_SYSTICK_Config() function
  68:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****        call. The HAL_NVIC_SetPriority() call the NVIC_SetPriority() function which is a CMSIS funct
  69:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
  70:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****    (+) To adjust the SysTick time base, use the following formula:
  71:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccR4QSax.s 			page 61


  72:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****        Reload Value = SysTick Counter Clock (Hz) x  Desired Time base (s)
  73:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****        (++) Reload Value is the parameter to be passed for HAL_SYSTICK_Config() function
  74:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****        (++) Reload Value should not exceed 0xFFFFFF
  75:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
  76:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   @endverbatim
  77:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   ******************************************************************************
  78:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
  79:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   The table below gives the allowed values of the pre-emption priority and subpriority according
  80:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   to the Priority Grouping configuration performed by HAL_NVIC_SetPriorityGrouping() function.
  81:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   
  82:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     ===============================================================================================
  83:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****       NVIC_PriorityGroup   | NVIC_IRQChannelPreemptionPriority | NVIC_IRQChannelSubPriority  |     
  84:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     ===============================================================================================
  85:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****      NVIC_PRIORITYGROUP_0  |                0                  |            0-15             | 0 bi
  86:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****                            |                                   |                             | 4 bi
  87:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  88:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****      NVIC_PRIORITYGROUP_1  |                0-1                |            0-7              | 1 bi
  89:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****                            |                                   |                             | 3 bi
  90:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  91:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****      NVIC_PRIORITYGROUP_2  |                0-3                |            0-3              | 2 bi
  92:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****                            |                                   |                             | 2 bi
  93:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  94:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****      NVIC_PRIORITYGROUP_3  |                0-7                |            0-1              | 3 bi
  95:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****                            |                                   |                             | 1 bi
  96:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  97:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****      NVIC_PRIORITYGROUP_4  |                0-15               |            0                | 4 bi
  98:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****                            |                                   |                             | 0 bi
  99:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     ===============================================================================================
 100:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
 101:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   */
