 145:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   * @brief  Set the priority grouping field (pre-emption priority and subpriority)
 146:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   *         using the required unlock sequence.
 147:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   * @param  PriorityGroup: The priority grouping bits length.
 148:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   *         This parameter can be one of the following values:
 149:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   *         @arg NVIC_PRIORITYGROUP_0: 0 bit  for pre-emption priority,
 150:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   *                                    4 bits for subpriority
 151:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   *         @arg NVIC_PRIORITYGROUP_1: 1 bit  for pre-emption priority,
 152:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   *                                    3 bits for subpriority
 153:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   *         @arg NVIC_PRIORITYGROUP_2: 2 bits for pre-emption priority,
 154:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   *                                    2 bits for subpriority
 155:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   *         @arg NVIC_PRIORITYGROUP_3: 3 bits for pre-emption priority,
 156:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   *                                    1 bit  for subpriority
 157:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   *         @arg NVIC_PRIORITYGROUP_4: 4 bits for pre-emption priority,
 158:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   *                                    0 bit  for subpriority
 159:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   * @note   When the NVIC_PriorityGroup_0 is selected, IRQ pre-emption is no more possible.
 160:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   *         The pending IRQ priority will be managed only by the subpriority.
